{"steam_appid":2947650,"steam_name":"Choppy Cuts","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2947650/509205446/5181234c96dfaf604eccbe1f539d07114352e93a/1770180410/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1770258382","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257278945/5ccfbb5d846bba6134ccdf7392cf2a5e8b7ddbc8/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1770258382","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947650/5fe8f8371d914636c32d86bf39f4c8981774b800/ss_5fe8f8371d914636c32d86bf39f4c8981774b800.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782379085","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947650/c0e960e72cd01a966395b5fee6401175a52c9088/ss_c0e960e72cd01a966395b5fee6401175a52c9088.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782379085","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947650/b7f2eeba8994d77b9e2110d86b975bacb2b53d13/ss_b7f2eeba8994d77b9e2110d86b975bacb2b53d13.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782379085","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947650/6e8c3d01fddb941750247c7ffde48a65aa14c56c/ss_6e8c3d01fddb941750247c7ffde48a65aa14c56c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782379085","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947650/a258c0616da62b4e9be9496f66bcc29be3ee411d/ss_a258c0616da62b4e9be9496f66bcc29be3ee411d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782379085"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chop chop. Make it quick! Throw everything, even customers! It's all about efficiency! Anyone in the way? A quick smack will keep things moving!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game supports 1-4 players, but you'll definitely want to bring friends for this one! Split up the tasks, combine your skills, and keep the chaos under control.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947650/extras/7a64e1cb93688a248ff08b4185bc5dab.avif?t=1782379085\" width=690 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Just seat the customers and handle every request they throw at you. Easy, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947650/extras/e5d953f7febadfd9bc62e7e620d173ef.poster.avif?t=1782379085\" width=690 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947650/extras/e5d953f7febadfd9bc62e7e620d173ef.webm?t=1782379085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947650/extras/e5d953f7febadfd9bc62e7e620d173ef.mp4?t=1782379085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947650/extras/a0d3165f44889e5965b69a7fb63967a4.avif?t=1782379085\" width=690 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Styling with friends is fun, but if my teammate starts slacking, they're getting a wake-up call!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947650/extras/f8499b7b52f2b60271a5a57144645198.poster.avif?t=1782379085\" width=690 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947650/extras/f8499b7b52f2b60271a5a57144645198.webm?t=1782379085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947650/extras/f8499b7b52f2b60271a5a57144645198.mp4?t=1782379085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947650/extras/066b63698a077a898fdb453e5ec05771.avif?t=1782379085\" width=690 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Build your team and sharpen your scissors! Tackle challenges from 50  levels of basic trims to wild frenzies across the world! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947650/extras/18898c5a86e20896f6455dbe3d6dee01.poster.avif?t=1782379085\" width=690 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947650/extras/18898c5a86e20896f6455dbe3d6dee01.webm?t=1782379085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947650/extras/18898c5a86e20896f6455dbe3d6dee01.mp4?t=1782379085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947650/extras/4aa511e90bcd3bc8978a72d2b7953558.avif?t=1782379085\" width=690 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each stylist has their distinct style and abilities. Work and build a team with your friends that will break chopping history. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947650/extras/d9b38fa9d33c4be41bf16b2457259726.poster.avif?t=1782379085\" width=690 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947650/extras/d9b38fa9d33c4be41bf16b2457259726.webm?t=1782379085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947650/extras/d9b38fa9d33c4be41bf16b2457259726.mp4?t=1782379085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947650/extras/cc1ccd41a0719af566a900f250d75e2a.avif?t=1782379085\" width=690 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Another ordinary shift? Think again! Protect your customers and business from incoming dangers. The future of Choppy Cuts is now in your hands! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947650/extras/c755a53570137d8a03fbca332884f10b.poster.avif?t=1782379085\" width=690 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947650/extras/c755a53570137d8a03fbca332884f10b.webm?t=1782379085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947650/extras/c755a53570137d8a03fbca332884f10b.mp4?t=1782379085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Win 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 11th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-1185G7 @ 3.00GHz 1.80 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel(R) Iris(R) Xe Graphics<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"","genres":["Action","Casual","Indie","Simulation","Strategy","Free To Play"],"developers":["Moco Studios I"],"publishers":["Moco Studios I"],"release_date":"4 Feb, 2026"}